    narr:narration """This position holds that a price change should take effect while buyers can still act on it and see it before paying. [Half-price day-old loaves at two in the afternoon rather than at close, so someone is left to buy them](narr:Expr_20261013_1_Batch2Bakery20261013214134_h503a9390982c_1) sets the timing; [the shelf card changing at two as well, so the price is never a surprise at the till](narr:Expr_20261013_1_Batch2Bakery20261013214134_h503a9390982c_2) adds the visibility side.""" ;
